_:c14n1 <https://www.w3.org/2019/wot/td#description> "Illustrative application-owned API. Resolve source inside its stated TD and require an authorized, supported JPEG read Form. Read one JPEG, verify 1280x720 geometry, decode and convert channels without resizing. Unsupported media, missing facts, native failures and authorization failures are errors, not implicit substitutions. An implementation is not supplied."@en <urn:example:av02:graph:processor.td.json> .
