_:c14n8 <https://www.w3.org/2019/wot/td#description> "Illustrative application-owned API, not implemented. Consume a BGR8 image identified by a successful local convert response. Compute the arithmetic mean of the blue uint8 channel over all 921600 pixels. A destination is honored only when explicitly supplied, authorized and compatible with this declared result; omission requests no push. Delivery and durability are not inferred from the output schema."@en <urn:example:av02:graph:processor.td.json> .
